{"id":"1e905acae71a7676","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion.md","title":"一元 PCP 的可判定符号判据","display":"thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion — 一元 PCP 的可判定符号判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion","aliases":["73-thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion"],"display":"thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion — 一元 PCP 的可判定符号判据","depends_on":["[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"Exercise 9.4.3, print p. 412; PDF p. 434; locally proved decision criterion","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion — 一元 PCP 的可判定符号判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" href=\"?note=ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" title=\"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions\">73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Exercise 9.4.3, print p. 412; PDF p. 434; locally proved decision criterion"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\ne\\varepsilon\">\\(a\\ne\\varepsilon\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\">\\(I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\">\\(u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\">\\(v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_i=|u_i|-|v_i|\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(d_i=|u_i|-|v_i|\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\{a\\}}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;d_i=0)\\lor(\\exists i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;d_i&gt;0\\land d_j&lt;0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\{a\\}}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;d_i=0)\\lor(\\exists i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;d_i&gt;0\\land d_j&lt;0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同长度的一块直接为解。若 dᵢ&gt;0&gt;dⱼ，取 −dⱼ 次第 i 块与 dᵢ 次第 j 块，长度差恰为零；一元词由长度唯一决定。若所有差都严格同号，任何非空块列表的总差也严格同号，不可能相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"a\\ne\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))","display":false},{"tex":"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))","display":false},{"tex":"d_i=|u_i|-|v_i|\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\{a\\}}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;d_i=0)\\lor(\\exists i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;d_i>0\\land d_j<0).","display":true}],"bytes":1404,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-unary-pcp-sign-criterion|一元 PCP 的可判定符号判据]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["ef2510d5b7c48e0c"]}